  "empty.help": "The sheet is empty and takes the whole screen. Text snaps to the grid, blocks never overlap. Pasted code becomes a locked code block. <span class=\"mouse\">Drag the mouse over an empty spot to draw an area: put blocks in it and move it as a whole. Hover over a line to see the <kbd>⋮⋮</kbd> handle — drag it to move the line.</span><span class=\"touch\">The «+» button at the bottom adds a block at the end. Hold your finger on an empty spot and drag to draw an area for blocks (it is also in the «⋯» menu at the top). Drag a line by the <kbd>⋮⋮</kbd> handle next to it.</span>",
